### -----------------------------------------------
### Binexus Platform — Environment variables
### Copy to .env (and never commit it)
### Values below are LOCAL DEV defaults only — not production secrets.
### Production: store Jwt__SigningKey, DB password, MinIO keys in a secret store
### (GitHub Actions secrets, Azure Key Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, etc.).
### -----------------------------------------------

### Node
NODE_ENV=development

### --- .NET API / Workers ---
### Host ports: Api :5102, Workers :5103, Web :3000, Postgres :5432, MinIO :9000/:9001
#
# Jwt__SigningKey — DEVELOPMENT ONLY — NEVER USE IN STAGING OR PRODUCTION.
# This is a known insecure placeholder. Staging/Production reject it at startup.
# Development/Testing allow it (optional sanitized warning).
Jwt__SigningKey=local-build-signing-key-with-more-than-thirty-two-bytes
Jwt__Issuer=binexus
Jwt__Audience=binexus-api
Jwt__AccessTokenDuration=00:15:00
Jwt__RefreshTokenDuration=7.00:00:00
Jwt__ClockSkew=00:00:30
# Demo seed password — DEVELOPMENT/TESTING ONLY (rejected in Production/Staging).
IdentitySeed__AdminPassword=ChangeMe123!
IdentitySeed__TenantSlug=acme
IdentitySeed__AdminEmail=admin@acme.test
ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development
DOTNET_ENVIRONMENT=Development
# Required. No image/code default. Current local/dev stack uses Cloud (PR1 compatibility).
Binexus__RuntimeMode=Cloud
BINEXUS_API_HOST_PORT=5102
BINEXUS_WORKERS_HOST_PORT=5103
# Host `dotnet run` / EF CLI. Compose services hardcode Host=postgres.
Database__ConnectionString=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=binexus;Username=binexus;Password=binexus
# Compose default: dedicated `migrate` service. Keep 0 on API/Workers replicas.
RUN_MIGRATIONS=0

### Logistics object storage
### Compose smoke uses MinIO with InternalEndpoint (container) + PublicEndpoint (browser/host).
Logistics__Storage__Provider=MinIO
Logistics__Storage__Endpoint=http://localhost:9000
Logistics__Storage__InternalEndpoint=http://localhost:9000
Logistics__Storage__PublicEndpoint=http://localhost:9000
Logistics__Storage__Bucket=binexus-dev
Logistics__Storage__AccessKey=binexus
Logistics__Storage__SecretKey=binexus123
Logistics__Storage__Region=us-east-1
# Host-only Local (dev object storage on Api): Provider=Local Endpoint=http://localhost:5102

Cors__AllowedOrigins__0=http://localhost:3000
Features__LiquidationKillSwitch=true

### --- Web (apps/web) — points at .NET ---
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5102

# Production/Staging: use a secret store for Jwt__SigningKey, DB, and MinIO credentials.
# Never commit real secrets. .env is gitignored.
